    "rawHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@tailwindcss/browser@4\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css\"\n        integrity=\"sha512-Evv84Mr4kqVGRNSgIGL/F/aIDqQb7xQ2vcrdIwxfjThSH8CSR7PBEakCr51Ck+w+/U6swU2Im1vVX0SVk9ABhg==\"\n        crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n    <title>My App</title>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"w-full h-screen\">\n    <nav\n        class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-20 bg-transparent backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg flex justify-between p-5 items-center z-50\">\n        <div class=\"mr-5\">\n           <h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl text-white font-semibold\">F.O.O.D.I.E</h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex gap-20 justify-between items-center\">\n            <ul class=\"flex gap-8\">\n                <li class=\"text-md font-semibold text-white cursor-pointer\">Home</li>\n                <li class=\"text-md font-semibold text-white cursor-pointer\">About</li>\n                <li class=\"text-md font-semibold text-white cursor-pointer\">Menu</li>\n                <li class=\"text-md font-semibold text-white cursor-pointer\">Contact</li>\n            </ul>\n            <form class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search\"\n                    class=\"shadow-lg py-1 px-5 border border-gray-300 rounded-l-lg text-white\" />\n                <button class=\"bg-red-500 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-r-lg\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex flex gap-5\">\n            <button\n                class=\"bg-red-500 text-white hover:bg-red-600 px-5 py-2 font-semibold rounded-lg cursor-pointer\">Login</button>\n            <button\n                class=\"border border-white text-white px-5 py-2 font-semibold rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:opacity-80\">SignUp</button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <section\n        class=\"relative w-full min-h-[90vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6 lg:px-16 py-16 md:py-32\">\n        <!-- Background Image -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center\"\n            style=\"background-image: url('https://plus.unsplash.com/premium_photo-1695762436987-1cf827e5f1dd?w=500&auto=format&fit=crop&q=60&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxzZWFyY2h8NTl8fGJ1cmdlcmFpfGVufDB8MHwwfHx8MA%3D%3D');\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-50\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 text-white max-w-2xl\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight\">\n                Welcome to Our Platform\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl\">\n                Discover amazing features and join us today.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-6\">\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                    class=\"group px-6 py-3 bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold transition inline-flex items-center\">\n                    Get Started\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"></i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"px-8 mt-8\">\n       \n        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-start font-semibold text-xl md:text-2xl\">Popular Dishes</h1>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-6 py-3 text-red-500  font-semibold rounded-lg hover:text-red-600 transition\">All</a>\n        </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-5\">\n            <!-- CARD 1 -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 shadow-lg flex flex-col bg-white\">\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                    <img class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"\n                        src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/61180/pexels-photo-61180.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=1&w=500\"\n                        alt=\"Simplest Salad Recipe\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-25 hover:opacity-0 transition\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs absolute top-2 right-2 bg-red-500 px-3 py-1 text-white rounded-lg\">#1</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-6 py-4 flex-grow\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-lg hover:text-red-600 transition\">Simplest Salad Recipe</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1\">A fresh and healthy salad recipe that's easy to prepare.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-6 py-3 flex justify-between bg-gray-100\">\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 text-red-500 border border-red-500 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white transition\">View</button>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-red-600 transition\">Add <i class=\"fa-solid fa-cart-plus\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n    \n            <!-- CARD 2 -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-gray-300 flex flex-col bg-white\">\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                    <img class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"\n                        src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/1600727/pexels-photo-1600727.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=1&w=500\"\n                        alt=\"FastFood Ideas\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-25 hover:opacity-0 transition\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs absolute top-2 right-2 bg-red-500 px-3 py-1 text-white rounded-lg\">#2</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-6 py-4 flex-grow\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-lg hover:text-red-600 transition\">Best FastFood Ideas</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1\">Quick and delicious fast food ideas to try at home.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-6 py-3 flex justify-between bg-gray-100\">\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 text-red-500 border border-red-500 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white transition\">View</button>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-red-600 transition\">Add <i class=\"fa-solid fa-cart-plus\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n    \n            <!-- CARD 3 -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-gray-300 flex flex-col bg-white\">\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                    <img class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"\n                        src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6086/food-salad-healthy-vegetables.jpg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=1&w=500\"\n                        alt=\"Why to eat salad?\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-25 hover:opacity-0 transition\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs absolute top-2 right-2 bg-red-500 px-3 py-1 text-white rounded-lg\">#3</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-6 py-4 flex-grow\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-semibold text-lg hover:text-red-600 transition\">Why to eat salad?</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1\">The benefits of including fresh salads in your daily diet.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-6 py-3 flex justify-between bg-gray-100\">\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 text-red-500 border border-red-500 rounded-lg hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white transition\">View</button>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-red-600 transition\">Add <i class=\"fa-solid fa-cart-plus\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    </section>\n    \n</body>\n\n</html>"
